sequenceDiagram
  participant I as Issuer
  participant U as User
  participant S as DocVerify Server
  participant P as IPFS
  participant B as Blockchain
  participant E as External Viewer

  rect rgb(245,245,245)
  note over I,B: 1. PUBLISH
  I->>S: upload document
  S->>P: watermark + encrypt, pin file
  P-->>S: return CID
  I->>B: record keccak-256 hash on-chain (MetaMask)
  S-->>U: notify - document received
  end

  rect rgb(255,255,255)
  note over U,S: 2. VIEW
  U->>S: login - email + OTP
  U->>S: open document
  S->>P: fetch ciphertext
  S-->>U: decrypt (AES-256) and display
  end

  rect rgb(245,245,245)
  note over U,B: 3. AUTHENTICITY CHECK
  U->>S: upload file to check
  S->>B: 4-layer check - hash, watermark, pHash, chain record
  B-->>S: fingerprint matches
  S-->>U: VERIFIED (+ WhatsApp / email alert)
  end

  rect rgb(255,255,255)
  note over U,E: 4. SHARE
  U->>S: create expiring share link
  S-->>U: private link (secret token)
  U->>E: send link (any channel)
  E->>S: open link - token + email code
  S-->>E: watermarked view-only copy
  note over S,E: expiry / revoke destroys the key - link dead forever
  end
